{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_192_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，王二月，叔弓如宋，葬宋平公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，丁巳，楚子虔誘蔡侯般，殺之於申。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"何為名之？夷狄之君誘中國之君，故謹而名之也。稱時稱月稱日稱地，謹之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"三、楚公子棄疾帥師圍蔡。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"四、五月，甲申，夫人歸氏薨。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"五、大蒐於比蒲。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"六、仲孫貜會邾子，盟於祲祥。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"七、秋，季孫意如會晉韓起、齊國弱、宋華亥、衞北宮佗、鄭罕虎、曹人、杞人於厥憖。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"八、九月，己亥，葬我小君齊歸","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"九、冬，十有一月，丁酉，楚師滅蔡，執蔡世子友以歸，用之。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_192_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_192","textTraditional":"此子也，其曰世子何也？不與楚殺也。一事注乎志，所以惡楚子也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}